This folder contains data collected from the internet about airfoils.
Each file should follow the csv format:

----------------------------------------------------------------------
    Xfoil polar. Reynolds number fixed. Mach  number fixed
    Polar key,xf-s7055-il-100000
    Airfoil,s7055-il
    Reynolds number,100000
    Ncrit,9
    Mach,0
    Max Cl/Cd,54.2877
    Max Cl/Cd alpha,7.75
    Url,http://airfoiltools.com/polar/csv?polar=xf-s7055-il-100000

    Alpha,Cl,Cd,Cdp,Cm,Top_Xtr,Bot_Xtr
